Description: KRunner plugin for openfortiGUI
 Starts an openfortiGUI connection straight from KRunner: type the name of a VPN
 profile or of a group of profiles and the plugin asks a running openfortiGUI to
 connect it, starting the application first if it is not up yet.
 .
 The plugin reads the same profiles as openfortiGUI itself and talks to it over
 its local socket. It requires KDE Frameworks 6; the Qt5/KF5 version is gone.
